# Local agent rules and internal engineering records. This is a public-facing
# portfolio repo; these are working notes, not part of the published site.
CLAUDE.md
# Everything in docs/ is an internal record except the maintenance notes, and that includes the
# recovered Codex transcript. Ignoring the folder and naming the one public file makes a new doc
# private by default; naming each private file instead let two of them ship. npm test checks it.
docs/*
!docs/maintenance.md
# Agent definitions are instructions for the coding assistant, not part of the site.
.claude/

# Page copy drafted before it becomes a real page. The owner edits these by hand;
# they are working documents, never part of the published site.
drafts/

# Internal engineering records - kept locally, never published
journal/
GOAL.md
localbackups/

# Personal CV exports. The two versionless files are the live public routes and stay
# tracked, so updating a CV means replacing those two files and nothing else. Every
# numbered export is a local archive of a superseded version and is not published.
/Abdullah-Mehtab-Master-CV-v*.pdf
/Abdullah-Mehtab-Cyber-CV-v*.pdf
